OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to consult public over
OL,4,Alatest #50m cuts plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-week public consultation is to be
OL,7,Fheld after Bradford Council outlined
OL,8,Fplans to save #50m.
OL,10,FThe Reform UK-led authority said it had
OL,11,Fidentified 42 areas where it was able
OL,12,Fto reduce outgoings.
OL,14,FThe council, which has been in receipt
OL,15,Fof Exceptional Financial Support (EFS)
OL,16,Ffrom the government since 2023, said
OL,17,Fthe proposed spending reductions came
OL,18,Fon top of the #150m already saved over
OL,19,Fthe past three years.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
