OL,4,Alatest #50m cuts plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the authority said
OL,7,Fif the savings were delivered 2027-28
OL,8,Fwould be the first year since 2022-23
OL,9,Fin which the EFS was not needed.
